-- =============================================================================
-- Element: extended company directory (M9c, SEC top-500 coverage, R-360).
-- Adds ~350 large US-listed companies (contract/companiesExtra.ts) to core.companies so their 8-K cards get a
-- company tag (filing method, confidence 1), a company page and a place in search. The rows are name-less
-- on purpose: no aliases, cues or bare-ticker match, so no card is tagged by a company name appearing in text.
-- No prices (rule 9). Idempotent (on conflict (ticker) do update); core.companies_derive fills the derived columns.
-- Run after 20261115000000_companies.sql. Retagging old cards is not needed (these companies have no cards yet);
-- new SEC cards are tagged by the core.tag_card trigger.
-- =============================================================================

-- BEGIN GENERATED EXTRA COMPANY SEED (scripts/gen-companies-sql.mjs; do not edit by hand)
on conflict (ticker) do update set
  name = excluded.name, short_name = excluded.short_name, cik = excluded.cik, exchange = excluded.exchange,
  sector = excluded.sector, industry = excluded.industry;
-- END GENERATED EXTRA COMPANY SEED
